            Tempat PKL SMK RPL di Malang Beserta Tugas dan Cara Daftarnya
          </h1>
          <p class="text-tc-muted text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed">
            {pageDesc}
          </p>
        </header>

        <!-- Gambar 1 -->
        <figure class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-tc-border bg-tc-bg">
          <img 
            src="/assets/img/pkl-smk-rpl-malang-1.webp" 
            alt="Siswa SMK RPL mengerjakan website saat PKL" 
